PerfLens Debian packages / PerfLens Debian 安装包
=================================================

The perflens package contains the unprivileged CLI, MCP server, Skill assets,
and a private locked Python runtime under /usr/lib/perflens. It never starts a
service during package installation.

perflens 包含普通用户 CLI、MCP Server、Skill 资产，以及位于
/usr/lib/perflens 的锁定 Python 运行依赖。安装软件包时不会启动系统服务。

The optional perflens-collector package adds perflens-admin and
perflens-collector entry points. It still does not install a policy, alter
sysctl/capabilities, or enable the Collector. Generate and review a policy as
an ordinary user, then explicitly deploy it as an administrator:

可选的 perflens-collector 包会增加 perflens-admin 和 perflens-collector
入口，但仍不会安装策略、修改 sysctl/capability 或启用 Collector。先由普通
用户生成并检查策略，再由管理员明确部署：

  perflens setup --project /absolute/project --prepare-collector --automatic-collection
  sudo perflens-admin deploy --config /absolute/project/perflens-setup/collector-assets/collector.toml

Before removing perflens-collector, stop and remove only the managed unit while
preserving policy and collected artifacts:

卸载 perflens-collector 前，可先移除托管服务；策略和采集数据默认保留：

  sudo perflens-admin undeploy

Run `perflens status --project /absolute/project` after a new login session.
重新登录后运行 `perflens status --project /绝对路径/项目` 检查状态。
